{"id":"n69343-1-10","stage":3,"title":"우연 · 偶然","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69343-1-10-1","ko":"와, 이런 곳에서 널 만날 줄은 정말 몰랐어.","zh":"哇，真没想到会在这种地方遇见你啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이런","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"이런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89753","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳에서","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"널","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만날","meaning":"遇见，偶遇，碰到","explanation":"만나다：遇见，偶遇，碰到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"4","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄은","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰랐어.","meaning":"不明白，不懂，未尝过","explanation":"모르다：不明白，不懂，未尝过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"3","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"89753","definition":"看到或者听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇见，偶遇，碰到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"在去往某地的途中，偶然碰到某人。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不明白，不懂，未尝过","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"没有经历过。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ae8aaf30aaeb62130a1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69343-1-10-2","ko":"정말 이런 우연도 다 있구나. 이렇게 만나니까 더 반갑다.","zh":"没想到还能有这样的巧合，能这样见面就更开心了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"其实，实际上，事实上","explanation":"정말：其实，实际上，事实上","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"2","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우연도","meaning":"偶然","explanation":"우연：偶然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우연","audio":"/audio/125d21ae5dc075b2921f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69343","senseId":"1","lemma":"우연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"连","explanation":"다：连","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"3","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있구나.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"이렇게：“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71156","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나니까","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반갑다.","meaning":"高兴，开心，喜悦","explanation":"반갑다：高兴，开心，喜悦；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70861","senseId":"1","lemma":"반갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"其实，实际上，事实上","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"表面看不到的事实。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"125d21ae5dc075b2","term":"우연","zh":"偶然","audio":"/audio/125d21ae5dc075b2921f.mp3","entryId":"69343","definition":"没有合适的理由，偶然间发生的事。","pronunciation":["우연"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"连","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"表示“出乎意料地”，含有轻微惊讶、感叹、嘲讽等意思。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"9a767a1c9118d82c","term":"이렇게","zh":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3","entryId":"71156","definition":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"d5cacddd111bc906","term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴，开心，喜悦","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3","entryId":"70861","definition":"因见到想见的人或实现了愿望而感到欢喜愉快。","pronunciation":["반갑따"]}],"audio":"/audio/12d7a14be6ac19f324f2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.932,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69343","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7587,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没想到还能有这样的巧合，能这样见面就更开心了。","哇，真没想到会在这种地方遇见你啊。","喂，你感冒了吗？声音怎么这么奇怪？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哇，真没想到会在这种地方遇见你啊。","喂，你感冒了吗？声音怎么这么奇怪？","没想到还能有这样的巧合，能这样见面就更开心了。"],"answer":2}]}
